WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.672 --> 00:00:15.619
Roxy helped gather the zoo animals.

2
00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:21.683
"Now I have to find Robin," she thought.

3
00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:24.884
Roxy flew to the Raptor Center.

4
00:00:26.765 --> 00:00:28.707
She spotted Terrell, Mara, and Jack.

5
00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:31.068
But Robin wasn't in sight.

6
00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:34.537
Roxy landed on top of the main building.

7
00:00:37.057 --> 00:00:39.238
Peeking through a window, Roxy saw Robin.

8
00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:41.758
The woman still wore her hawk disguise.

9
00:00:43.079 --> 00:00:44.279
Roxy leaped through the window.

10
00:00:44.299 --> 00:00:48.180
"I've got you, Thunderhawk!"

11
00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.060
Robin gasped.

12
00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:51.321
Then her face had a nasty look.

13
00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:53.242
She raised her wings.

14
00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:56.903
"Hurricane—" Zoom!

15
00:00:57.663 --> 00:00:59.023
Roxy charged at the villain.

16
00:00:59.763 --> 00:01:02.124
They crashed through the wall and landed on the ground below.

17
00:01:03.956 --> 00:01:04.276
"Rocket Girl!"

18
00:01:04.516 --> 00:01:05.197
Mara cried.

19
00:01:06.337 --> 00:01:09.238
As Roxy and Robin wrestled, Terrell watched anxiously.

20
00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:12.520
Finally Roxy pinned Robin to the ground.

21
00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.601
"Give up, Thunderhawk!"

22
00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:16.421
Robin let out a cry.

23
00:01:16.441 --> 00:01:18.462
"Kee, kee!"

24
00:01:19.363 --> 00:01:20.663
Roxy was confused.

25
00:01:21.303 --> 00:01:22.424
"What are you doing?"

26
00:01:23.244 --> 00:01:24.085
Robin ignored her.

27
00:01:24.105 --> 00:01:26.025
"Kee, kee!"

28
00:01:27.266 --> 00:01:29.707
With a rushing sound, raptors swooped down.

29
00:01:30.587 --> 00:01:31.568
They clawed at Roxy.

30
00:01:35.216 --> 00:01:37.077
"Hey!" Roxy waved her arms to protect herself.

31
00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.378
"What's going on?"

32
00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:41.600
Robin slipped free.

33
00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:45.502
"I can speak to birds, Rocket Girl.

34
00:01:45.942 --> 00:01:48.423
I protect them, so they protect me!"

35
00:01:49.884 --> 00:01:51.665
Roxy tried to shoo away the raptors.

36
00:01:51.685 --> 00:01:55.367
"I don't want to hurt these birds," she thought.

37
00:01:56.308 --> 00:01:57.028
"Rocket Girl!"

38
00:01:57.308 --> 00:01:58.008
Terrell cried.

39
00:01:58.028 --> 00:01:59.829
"Use your super breath!"

40
00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.152
Roxy saw that Terrell was standing near a large open cage.

41
00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:06.665
Whoosh! She blew.

42
00:02:09.065 --> 00:02:11.326
Her super breath swept the birds into the cage.

43
00:02:12.566 --> 00:02:15.267
Terrell threw the door shut.

44
00:02:16.027 --> 00:02:16.887
Robin flew off.

45
00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:21.508
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams burned Robin's wings.

46
00:02:21.529 --> 00:02:26.230
"Ahh!" Robin fell from the sky.

47
00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.750
Roxy flew fast and caught her.

48
00:02:31.071 --> 00:02:32.051
"Rocket Girl!"

49
00:02:32.391 --> 00:02:32.972
Robin said.

50
00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.021
"You saved me!"

51
00:02:38.182 --> 00:02:39.924
Roxy brought Robin down to the ground.

52
00:02:39.944 --> 00:02:43.926
"I care about birds too," Roxy said.

53
00:02:43.946 --> 00:02:45.908
"But you're still in trouble."

54
00:02:46.788 --> 00:02:47.669
Robin hung her head.

55
00:02:47.689 --> 00:02:50.511
"I just wanted to help birds."

56
00:02:53.053 --> 00:02:55.234
"I have an idea," Roxy said.

57
00:02:57.696 --> 00:03:00.258
First, Rocket Girl and Thunderhawk visited Mayor Bloom.

58
00:03:00.918 --> 00:03:03.260
Robin told him how vultures help the environment.

59
00:03:04.448 --> 00:03:05.988
"Very well," the mayor said.

60
00:03:06.008 --> 00:03:08.809
"We won't cut down the trees in the park."

61
00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.310
Next, they visited the apartment building.

62
00:03:14.571 --> 00:03:16.731
Robin told the residents how amazing hawks are.

63
00:03:17.992 --> 00:03:19.092
The people looked upset.

64
00:03:19.892 --> 00:03:23.933
"We're very sorry about the nest," a woman said.

65
00:03:25.354 --> 00:03:28.434
After that, Robin promised Roxy she wouldn't cause any more trouble.

66
00:03:30.235 --> 00:03:32.436
"And I'll pay for all the damage."

67
00:03:34.996 --> 00:03:37.517
The next day Roxy and her friends were in Metro City Park.

68
00:03:37.537 --> 00:03:41.739
"Cool!" Jack said when he saw vultures in the trees.

69
00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:43.840
Roxy smiled.

70
00:03:45.221 --> 00:03:46.922
Then she looked up at the apartment building.

71
00:03:49.463 --> 00:03:51.604
A hawk was starting to build a new nest.
